Flare

Left mouse button  walk, attack, pick up, talk
Right mouse button  the power on the action bar
W, A, S, D or cursor keys  walk
Q, E, R, F and 1 to 6  action bar powers
C  character, I  inventory, P  powers, L  log
M  minimap, Tab  swap equipment
Esc  menu (Configuration has the keys and full screen)
